    "Re-install on any device — your purchase stays with your Apple ID." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "別の端末に入れ直しても復元できます。購入は Apple ID に紐づきます。"
